      </ul>
      <h2 id="ts-capi-sync-list-duplicate-resources_cluster-api-troubleshooting" class="group scroll-mt-20">Duplicated machine set and machine resources<a href="#ts-capi-sync-list-duplicate-resources_cluster-api-troubleshooting" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
